            </note>
            <note corresp="#d393-f2" n="2" xml:id="d393-f2-content">
                <p>Former President of Panama, rumored to have been instrumental in forming a group
                    in southern Mexico for purpose of planning the overthrow of governments of
                    Panama and other countries.</p>
            </note>
